%p
  %h2
    The contenders
    %p
      The <a href="https://betafoils.com">Freefoil</a> as well as the
      <a href="https://indiana-paddlesurf.com">Indiana Condor XL</a> are
      both in the high aspect, high surface league. Both at one point
      in time did hold the world record for longest pump
      foil. Supposedly they open up the world of longer distance
      foiling also to the "masses". Its still hard, but not as hard as
      on smaller foils to go longer distances (say 1min, 1km, 5min, ...).
    %p
      When I started with pumpfoiling (and I am still at the very
      beginning), I decided that one of those would be a good choice
      as my fitness level is not yet "there". At the point of my
      start, one of the foils was not available, so I started with
      Betafoils Freefoil. Now I also had the chance to compare it to
      the Condor XL and the differences are so big, that I want to
      collect them here.
